# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The only post-processing step is to combine the expectation value obtained "
"from the Qiskit Runtime primitives at different Trotter steps using the "
"respective MPF coefficients. For an observable $A$ we have:\n"
msgstr ""
"خطوة المعالجة اللاحقة الوحيدة هي دمج قيمة التوقع المُستخرَجة من الأدوات "
"الأولية لـ Qiskit Runtime عند خطوات Trotter المختلفة باستخدام معاملات MPF "
"المقابلة. للمُراقِبة $A$ يكون لدينا:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$ \\langle A \\rangle_{\\text{mpf}}  = \\text{Tr} [A \\mu(t)] = \\sum_{j} "
"x_j  \\text{Tr} [A \\rho_{k_j}] = \\sum_{j} x_j \\langle A \\rangle_j$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\langle A \\rangle_{\\text{mpf}}  = \\text{Tr} [A \\mu(t)] = \\sum_{j} "
"x_j  \\text{Tr} [A \\rho_{k_j}] = \\sum_{j} x_j \\langle A \\rangle_j$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
